export const HTML = "<header class=\"cover\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Character sheet · for AI video</div><h1>Khao Hom<span lang=\"th\">ข้าวหอม</span></h1><p>The Jaosamut kitchen cat. Everything an animator, designer or AI video tool needs to keep him on-model: turnaround, 20 expressions, lip-sync mouths, poses, outfits, props and voice.</p><nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"Sections\"><a href=\"#identity\">01 Identity</a><a href=\"#descriptor\">02 Description</a><a href=\"#colours\">03 Colours</a><a href=\"#construction\">04 Construction</a><a href=\"#turnaround\">05 Turnaround</a><a href=\"#expressions\">06 Expressions</a><a href=\"#mouths\">07 Lip-sync</a><a href=\"#poses\">08 Poses</a><a href=\"#outfits\">09 Outfits</a><a href=\"#props\">10 Props</a><a href=\"#settings\">11 Settings</a><a href=\"#voice\">12 Voice</a><a href=\"#model\">13 On-model</a><a href=\"#ai-video\">14 AI video</a></nav></header><section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"identity\"><div class=\"secnum\">01</div><h2>Who he is</h2><p class=\"lead\">The Jaosamut kitchen cat. Everything about him starts here.</p>\n<div class=\"hero\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/turnaround/01-front.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom front view\" class=\"hero-img\">\n<div class=\"facts\">\n<p class=\"name\">Khao Hom <span lang=\"th\">ข้าวหอม</span></p>\n<p class=\"meaning\">\"Fragrant rice (jasmine rice)\" · say <b>KOW-hom</b></p>\n<dl><dt>Breed</dt><dd>Domestic cat, British Shorthair, ginger (red) tabby</dd><dt>Role</dt><dd>The Jaosamut kitchen cat and taste-tester. Mascot for stickers, social video, in-app moments, festive campaigns and kids' content.</dd>\n<dt>Personality</dt><dd>Proud of the food, like the uncle in the brand voice; Cheeky and a little mischievous; Warm host who wants you to enjoy your meal; Food-obsessed, above all fish; Easily distracted by anything that swims</dd>\n<dt>Loves</dt><dd>Fresh fish (his weakness); The smell of jasmine rice; Watching the wok fire; Customers who finish their plate</dd><dt>Dislikes</dt><dd>Cold food; Water splashes (except during Songkran); Anyone saying the food is 'okay lah'</dd>\n<dt>Says (EN)</dt><dd>How was it? · Wok's on! · Fresh from the sea, straight to you. · Psst... is that fish?</dd><dt>Says (BM)</dt><dd>Sedap tak? · Jom makan! · Segar dari laut! · Eh... tu ikan ke?</dd></dl>\n<p class=\"story\">Khao Hom wandered into the Jaosamut kitchen as a kitten, following the smell of jasmine rice. He never left. Uncle gave him a tiny chef hat and a green neckerchief, and now he checks every plate before it goes out. He has been chasing the same little blue fish around the restaurant ever since. He has never caught it.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"descriptor\"><div class=\"secnum\">02</div><h2>Locked description</h2><p class=\"lead\">Paste this word for word into every image and video prompt. Changing even one word lets the AI drift.</p>\n<p class=\"mini\">SHORT · FOR EVERY PROMPT</p><pre class=\"code\">Khao Hom, a chubby ginger tabby British Shorthair cat chef in flat 2D cartoon style with thick dark green outlines: round face, round copper-orange eyes, cream muzzle and chest, M-shaped forehead stripes, small white chef hat between upright ears, white chef jacket, Pandan Green neckerchief.</pre>\n<p class=\"mini\">LONG · FOR FIRST GENERATIONS AND NEW TOOLS</p><pre class=\"code\">Khao Hom, an original chubby male ginger tabby British Shorthair cat dressed as a chef, drawn in flat 2D vector cartoon style with thick, even dark green (#0C2B18) outlines and flat colours, no gradients. Round broad face with full cheeks, large round copper-orange eyes with dark pupils and white highlights, small pink nose, cream muzzle, chin and chest. Warm orange fur (#F09743) with darker rust tabby stripes (#B35D21): an M marking on the forehead, stripes on the cheeks, back and legs, and a thick ringed tail. Pink inner ears and pink paw pads. A SMALL white chef hat sits between his two upright triangular ears, with both ears fully visible. White double-breasted chef jacket with dark buttons, and a Pandan Green (#33A02C) neckerchief tied at the front. Cat paws, not human hands. Cute but not babyish.</pre>\n<p class=\"mini\">NEGATIVE / KEEP ON-MODEL</p><ul class=\"neg\"><li>do not resemble Garfield or any existing cartoon cat</li><li>no heavy half-closed eyelids, no big oval double snout</li><li>no human hands or fingers; always round cat paws</li><li>chef hat never covers or hides the ears; hat stays small</li><li>no extra tails, extra ears or extra limbs</li><li>no gradients, no realistic fur texture, no 3D rendering, no shading</li><li>never remove the green neckerchief</li><li>no text, no letters, no logos in the image</li><li>not grey, not white, not black fur; always ginger tabby</li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"colours\"><div class=\"secnum\">03</div><h2>Colour callouts</h2><p class=\"lead\">Sampled from the approved art. Use these exact values when describing or correcting him.</p><div class=\"swatches\"><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#F09743\"></i><b>Ginger fur</b><code>#F09743</code><small>Main body and head fur</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#F4A14D\"></i><b>Ginger light</b><code>#F4A14D</code><small>Highlight areas of fur</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#B35D21\"></i><b>Rust stripes</b><code>#B35D21</code><small>Tabby stripes, M marking, tail rings</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#F9E7CA\"></i><b>Cream</b><code>#F9E7CA</code><small>Muzzle, chin, chest, belly, inner paws</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#FAB447\"></i><b>Copper eyes</b><code>#FAB447</code><small>Iris</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#FABAA9\"></i><b>Blush pink</b><code>#FABAA9</code><small>Nose, inner ears, paw pads</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#0C2B18\"></i><b>Kaffir Ink</b><code>#0C2B18</code><small>All outlines, pupils, jacket buttons</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"></i><b>Chef white</b><code>#FFFFFF</code><small>Chef hat and jacket</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#33A02C\"></i><b>Pandan Green</b><code>#33A02C</code><small>Neckerchief (never changes)</small></div><div class=\"sw\"><i style=\"background:#A3B9BE\"></i><b>Fish blue</b><code>#A3B9BE</code><small>The little fish sidekick</small></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"construction\"><div class=\"secnum\">04</div><h2>Construction &amp; markings</h2><p class=\"lead\">The details that make him him. Check these first when an image looks off.</p>\n<div class=\"grid2\"><table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>Proportion</th><th>Spec</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Head To Body</td><td>Head is about 45% of total height (chibi proportions)</td></tr><tr><td>Head</td><td>Wider than tall (about 1.15 : 1), round full cheeks</td></tr><tr><td>Hat</td><td>About 40% of head width, sits between the ears</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Large, spaced about one eye-width apart, centred on the head</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>About knee-high to an adult; a wok is half his height</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>Marking</th><th>Spec</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Forehead</td><td>M-shaped tabby marking, 3 stripes</td></tr><tr><td>Cheeks</td><td>3 short stripes on each cheek</td></tr><tr><td>Whiskers</td><td>3 whiskers per side</td></tr><tr><td>Back</td><td>Broad rust stripes across the back, visible from behind and side</td></tr><tr><td>Tail</td><td>Thick, short tail with 5 rust rings, darker tip</td></tr><tr><td>Paws</td><td>4 toes visible, pink beans on the underside</td></tr><tr><td>Ears</td><td>Upright, slightly rounded triangles, pink inside</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"turnaround\"><div class=\"secnum\">05</div><h2>Turnaround</h2><p class=\"lead\">Same pose, same scale, five angles. The single most important reference for AI video.</p><div class=\"row5\"><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/turnaround/01-front.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, front\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>front</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/turnaround/02-three-quarter-front.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, three quarter front\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>three quarter front</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/turnaround/03-side.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, side\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>side</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/turnaround/04-three-quarter-back.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, three quarter back\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>three quarter back</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/turnaround/05-back.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, back\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>back</b></figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"expressions\"><div class=\"secnum\">06</div><h2>Expressions</h2><p class=\"lead\">Twenty faces, same angle and framing. 'How was it?' is his signature.</p><div class=\"grid5\"><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/01-neutral.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, neutral\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>neutral</b><small>Eyes round and open, mouth a soft closed smile. Default resting face.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/02-happy.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, happy\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>happy</b><small>Eyes open and bright, small open smile showing a pink tongue.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/03-laughing.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, laughing\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>laughing</b><small>Eyes squeezed into happy arcs, mouth wide open.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/04-proud.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, proud\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>proud</b><small>Chin up, confident closed smirk, eyes half-relaxed but not sleepy.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/05-cheeky.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, cheeky\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>cheeky</b><small>One brow up, sideways grin, a mischievous glint.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/06-hungry.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, hungry\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>hungry</b><small>Eyes looking up at food, tongue out, a drop of drool.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/07-excited.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, excited\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>excited</b><small>Star-shaped sparkle eyes, wide open grin, small sparkle marks.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/08-surprised.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, surprised\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>surprised</b><small>Eyes extra wide, small round O mouth, little alert marks.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/09-shocked.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, shocked\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>shocked</b><small>Huge eyes with small pupils, ears back, wide open mouth.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-1/10-confused.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, confused\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>confused</b><small>Head tilt, one ear folded down, wavy mouth.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/01-thinking.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, thinking\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>thinking</b><small>Paw on chin, eyes looking up and to the side, mouth flat.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/02-sad.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, sad\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>sad</b><small>Ears droop, brows tilt up in the middle, small frown.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/03-crying.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, crying\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>crying</b><small>Big blue tear streams, wobbly open mouth.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/04-grumpy.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, grumpy\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>grumpy</b><small>Furrowed brows, pout, arms crossed.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/05-sleepy.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, sleepy\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>sleepy</b><small>Heavy half-closed eyes, yawn, small bubble (no letters).</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/06-embarrassed.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, embarrassed\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>embarrassed</b><small>Pink blush on the cheeks, shy smile, eyes looking away.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/07-in-love.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, in love\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>in love</b><small>Eyes closed in happy arcs, smile, small pink hearts.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/08-determined.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, determined\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>determined</b><small>Focused eyes, firm smile, fist up, hat slightly tilted.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/09-wink.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, wink\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>wink</b><small>One eye closed, playful open smile, paw wave.</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/expressions-2/10-how-was-it.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, how was it\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>how was it</b><small>Signature face. Leans forward, big hopeful eyes, brows raised, small smile, as if asking 'How was it?'</small></figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"mouths\"><div class=\"secnum\">07</div><h2>Mouth shapes for lip-sync</h2><p class=\"lead\">Ten shapes cover English and Bahasa Melayu speech. Eyes stay the same; only the mouth moves.</p><div class=\"grid5\"><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/01-rest.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, rest\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>REST</b><small>Silence, between words · EN: (pause) · BM: (jeda)</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/02-a-i.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, a i\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>A / I</b><small>Open vowels · EN: hAt, rIce, cAt · BM: mAkAn, nAsI</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/03-e.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, e\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>E</b><small>Spread vowels, wide smile · EN: sEE, mEAt, yEs · BM: sEdap, kEtam</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/04-o.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, o\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>O</b><small>Round vowels · EN: hOt, wOk · BM: bOleh, tOm yam</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/05-u.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, u\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>U</b><small>Pursed vowels · EN: fOOd, sOUp · BM: Udang, sUp</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/06-m-b-p.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, m b p\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>M / B / P</b><small>Lips closed · EN: Mmm, Bowl, Prawn · BM: Makan, Baik, Pedas</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/07-f-v.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, f v\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>F / V</b><small>Top teeth on lower lip · EN: Fish, Very · BM: Fikir (rare in BM)</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/08-l-th.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, l th\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>L / TH</b><small>Tongue on top teeth · EN: Lime, THe, THanks · BM: Lauk, Lada</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/09-w-q.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, w q\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>W / Q</b><small>Pushed-forward pucker · EN: Wok, Wow, Quick · BM: Wah, Wangi</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/mouths/10-consonants.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, consonants\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>CONSONANTS</b><small>Most other consonants · EN: Sedap, Taste, Good, Nice · BM: Sedap, Tak, Garam, Nasi</small></figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"poses\"><div class=\"secnum\">08</div><h2>Poses &amp; actions</h2><p class=\"lead\">Full-body acting references. </p><div class=\"grid5\"><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/poses/01-sitting.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, sitting\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>sitting</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/poses/02-presenting-tom-yam.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, presenting tom yam\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>presenting tom yam</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/poses/03-wok-toss.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, wok toss\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>wok toss</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/poses/04-carrying-tray.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, carrying tray\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>carrying tray</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/poses/06-thumbs-up.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, thumbs up\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>thumbs up</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/poses/07-jumping-joy.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, jumping joy\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>jumping joy</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/poses/09-selfie.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, selfie\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>selfie</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/poses/10-pouncing-fish.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, pouncing fish\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>pouncing fish</b></figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"outfits\"><div class=\"secnum\">09</div><h2>Festive outfits</h2><p class=\"lead\">Only the jacket changes. The small chef hat, visible ears and Pandan Green neckerchief always stay. Respectful, no religious symbols.</p><div class=\"row5\"><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/outfits/01-hari-raya.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, hari raya\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>hari raya</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/outfits/02-chinese-new-year.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, chinese new year\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>chinese new year</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/outfits/03-songkran.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, songkran\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>songkran</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/outfits/04-deepavali.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, deepavali\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>deepavali</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/outfits/05-christmas.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, christmas\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>christmas</b></figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"props\"><div class=\"secnum\">10</div><h2>Props &amp; the fish</h2><p class=\"lead\">His kit, and the little blue fish he has chased for years and never caught.</p><div class=\"grid4\"><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/props/01-wok.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, wok\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>wok</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/props/02-ladle.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, ladle\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>ladle</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/props/03-fish-sidekick.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, fish sidekick\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>fish sidekick</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/props/04-tom-yam-bowl.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, tom yam bowl\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>tom yam bowl</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/props/05-chef-hat.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, chef hat\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>chef hat</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/props/06-neckerchief.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, neckerchief\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>neckerchief</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/props/07-serving-tray.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, serving tray\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>serving tray</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile \"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/props/08-phone.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, phone\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>phone</b></figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"settings\"><div class=\"secnum\">11</div><h2>Settings</h2><p class=\"lead\">Empty background plates for scenes: the kitchen, the dining room with the herb wall, and a clean Pandan Green backdrop.</p><div class=\"stack\"><figure class=\"tile wide\"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/settings/01-kitchen.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, kitchen\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>kitchen</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile wide\"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/settings/02-dining-room.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, dining room\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>dining room</b></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tile wide\"><div class=\"pic\"><img src=\"/khao-hom/img/settings/03-pandan-backdrop.webp\" alt=\"Khao Hom, pandan backdrop\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><b>pandan backdrop</b></figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"voice\"><div class=\"secnum\">12</div><h2>Voice</h2><p class=\"lead\">He speaks English and Bahasa Melayu. Audition the three voices in ElevenLabs Voice Design (or your video tool's voice feature) using the sample lines, then lock one.</p>\n<div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"voice\"><b>Warm Uncle</b><small>Best for: Brand voice, adverts, 'How was it?'</small><pre class=\"code\">A warm, friendly middle-aged Malaysian man in his late 40s with a light Thai-Malaysian accent. Medium-low pitch, slightly gravelly, unhurried, proud and kind, with a smile in the voice. Speaks clear English and casual Bahasa Melayu. Sounds like a beloved restaurant uncle checking on your meal.</pre></div><div class=\"voice\"><b>Young & Cheeky</b><small>Best for: Social reels, memes, fish-chasing gags</small><pre class=\"code\">A playful young Malaysian man in his early 20s, bright and energetic, medium pitch with a mischievous, teasing tone and quick comic timing. Light Malaysian English accent, slips naturally into casual Bahasa Melayu. Sounds like a cheeky friend who is always hungry.</pre></div><div class=\"voice\"><b>Soft & Friendly</b><small>Best for: Kids' content, in-app moments, stories</small><pre class=\"code\">A gentle, cheerful young voice of a small cartoon character, slightly higher pitch but not squeaky, warm and clear, speaks slowly and kindly. Light Malaysian English accent, clear standard Bahasa Melayu. Suitable for children's stories.</pre></div></div><p class=\"mini\">PRONUNCIATION</p><p>KOW-hom. 'Khao' rhymes with 'cow', 'Hom' rhymes with 'mom'. Not 'kay-oh'.</p>\n<table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>English</th><th>Bahasa Melayu</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>How was it? Be honest, I made it with my own paws.</td><td>Sedap tak? Cakap betul-betul, saya masak sendiri ni.</td></tr><tr><td>Your order's in. The wok's on!</td><td>Pesanan dah masuk. Kuali dah panas!</td></tr><tr><td>Wait... was that a fish?</td><td>Eh, tunggu... tu ikan ke?</td></tr></tbody></table></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"model\"><div class=\"secnum\">13</div><h2>On-model, off-model</h2><p class=\"lead\">When a generation breaks any of these, regenerate it. Don't keep it.</p>\n<div class=\"dd\"><div class=\"do\"><b>On-model</b><ul><li>Ginger with rust stripes, M on the forehead, ringed tail</li><li>Small hat between two visible ears</li><li>Green neckerchief, white chef jacket</li><li>Round cat paws with pink beans</li><li>Flat colours, thick dark green outline</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"dont\"><b>Off-model</b><ul><li>Human fingers or hands</li><li>Missing jacket or neckerchief</li><li>Hat covering the ears, or a tall hat</li><li>Grey, white or black fur; heavy half-closed eyelids</li><li>Gradients, 3D fur, realistic shading, text in the image</li></ul></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"ai-video\"><div class=\"secnum\">14</div><h2>Using him in AI video</h2><p class=\"lead\">References carry his look; the prompt carries the action. Works with Kling, Veo/Flow, Runway, Seedance and Hailuo.</p>\n<table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Feature</th><th>Upload from the pack</th><th>How</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Kling</b></td><td>Elements (2–4 images) or Omni Reference</td><td>kling/: front, three-quarter front, side, presenting pose</td><td>Create an Element from the 4 images. Bind it in the prompt (\"@Khao Hom\") and give each image a role. Once you have one good clip, make a 3–8 s video Element from it: the strongest consistency method.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Google Veo / Flow</b></td><td>Ingredients (up to 3 images)</td><td>veo-flow/: portrait (happy close-up), side profile, full-body front</td><td>Upload the 3 ingredients and describe actions, not looks. The references carry his appearance. Reuse the same 3 for every shot.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Runway</b></td><td>References (stills), then image-to-video</td><td>runway/: front, three-quarter front</td><td>Make the scene as a still with References first. Check he is on-model, then animate that still.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Seedance</b></td><td>Reference assets, one view per image</td><td>seedance/: front, three-quarter front, side, back (separate files)</td><td>Upload views as separate images (not a combined sheet). Bind them by upload order in the prompt.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Hailuo</b></td><td>Subject reference (one image)</td><td>hailuo/: front</td><td>Use the clean front view. Keep shots short and repeat the locked descriptor.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mini\">PROMPT TEMPLATE</p><pre class=\"code\">[References] @Image1 = Khao Hom front view · @Image2 = three-quarter view · @Image3 = side view · @Image4 = full-body pose\n\nCHARACTER: Khao Hom, a chubby ginger tabby British Shorthair cat chef in flat 2D cartoon style with thick dark green outlines: round face, round copper-orange eyes, cream muzzle and chest, M-shaped forehead stripes, small white chef hat between upright ears, white chef jacket, Pandan Green neckerchief.\nACTION: &lt;what he does, one clear action per shot&gt;\nSETTING: &lt;Jaosamut kitchen / dining room with herb wall / Pandan Green backdrop&gt;\nCAMERA: &lt;e.g. medium shot, slow push-in, eye level&gt;\nSTYLE: flat 2D vector cartoon, thick even dark green outlines, flat colours, no gradients.\nKEEP ON-MODEL: do not resemble Garfield or any existing cartoon cat; no heavy half-closed eyelids, no big oval double snout; no human hands or fingers; always round cat paws; chef hat never covers or hides the ears; hat stays small; no extra tails, extra ears or extra limbs; no gradients, no realistic fur texture, no 3D rendering, no shading; never remove the green neckerchief; no text, no letters, no logos in the image; not grey, not white, not black fur; always ginger tabby.</pre>\n<ul class=\"rules\"><li>Same locked description in every prompt, word for word. Order: character, action, setting, camera, style.</li>\n<li>Give every reference image a role in the prompt. Never write his name inside an image.</li>\n<li>Make a start frame first (a still built from the references), then animate it.</li>\n<li>Keep him in frame. If he leaves the shot, the next shot may redraw him.</li>\n<li>Avoid long \"extend\" chains; generate fresh shots from the references instead.</li>\n<li>One character per generation where possible; composite group scenes.</li>\n<li>Voice: record lines with the chosen voice first, then lip-sync using the mouth shapes as a guide.</li></ul>\n</section>\n"
